          "text": "This plan assumes your accommodation is centrally located, such as near Kyoto Station or in the Downtown Kawaramachi area, for easy access to public transportation. The budget is mid-range, and all entry fees are estimates per person and subject to change. For transport, an ICOCA or Suica card is recommended for pay-as-you-go convenience on trains and buses. Note that early November is a peak season for autumn foliage, so expect popular sites to be busy, especially on weekends."
